{"find": "[[page ?]]\n\n112 BY THE CORNISIT SEA.\n\nCHAPTER VII. BILLING AND COOING.\n\nLive with me, and be my love,\n\nAnd we will all the pleasures prove\n\nThat hills and valleys, dales and fields,\n\nAnd all the craggy mountains yields.\n\nShakespeare.", "replace": "[[page 112]]\n\n# Chapter VII.\n\n[[subtitle]] Billing and Cooing.\n\n<verse>\nLive with me, and be my love,\nAnd we will all the pleasures prove\nThat hills and valleys, dales and fields,\nAnd all the craggy mountains yields.\n</verse>\n[[right]] <i>Shakespeare.</i>"}
